  "critique": {
    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The red-mutator versus blue-defense framing, oversized thesis, split-color arena, replay curve, and fraud phylogeny form a coherent and recognizable visual idea. However, much of the execution still reads as a dark cyber dashboard: bordered cards, status pills, a basic line chart, numbered lists, and pipeline tiles. The distinctive phylogeny is tiny on desktop and collapses into ordinary rows on tablet/mobile, weakening the strongest demo-worthy artifact.",
    "fix": "Make the mutation-versus-defense arena the unmistakable centerpiece: enlarge the phylogeny into a legible interactive battle map linked to replay rounds and survivors, preserve a meaningful visual form on smaller screens, and reduce generic cards/pills around it.",
